PROVED: B_L = b * (3^(L-1) + 3^(L-2) 2^(K_1) + ... + 2^(K_(L-1))) depends only on (b, word);
  B_L is odd (first term odd, others even), so v_2(B_L) = 0 always, on both sheets;
  B_L(word, -1) = -B_L(word, +1) exactly; every word is realised on both sheets (residue bijection, control S2).

